#created by Duel Circuit - No Limits: Fiendsmith Snake-Eye, summer 2024 (Junia "Spoils")
#title Fiendsmith Snake-Eye (2024, uncut)
#era 2024
#tier No Limits peak build: the end chair (wave 1) (docs/dev/NO-LIMITS-SPEC-2026-11-02.md section 5)
#about Won the 2024 North America WCQ, the year's biggest room (2,635 players, 29 of the Top 64 on this deck). Snake-Eye Ash and Diabellstar mill and revive FIRE monsters into a multi-interruption board; the Fiendsmith engine, new that summer, adds Lacrima, Desirae and a second line through any hand trap. Here with three Original Sinful Spoils, three Poplar and the old Spell/Trap Zone tools it was built to abuse.
#why Peak list: July 2024; restored: Original Sinful Spoils - Snake-Eye x3, Snake-Eye Ash x3, Snake-Eyes Poplar x3, Fiendsmith's Lacrima (Extra, 1); picks: Union Carrier (Extra), Card of Safe Return, Soul Charge, Blaster, Dragon Ruler of Infernos; cuts: Effect Veiler x3 (hand traps), Silhouhatte Rabbit (Extra). Measured 2026-11-03: rated 1728 (+116 over snake-eye 1612).
#banlist TCG April 2024
#recipe snake-eye
